Package: armatos-lapicida
Version: 2779.1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: coreutils, util-linux, sudo
Recommends: whiptail, armatos-voice
Maintainer: factionparadox <factionparadox@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: lapicida — the stonecutter: write an ISO to a USB stick
 Offers only removable USB drives, never internal disks or the drive the ISO
 is on, asks you to type the stick's name before erasing it, checks the ISO
 against a .sha256 or SHA256SUMS file if one is beside it, and reads the stick
 back afterwards to verify every byte.
